  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "With Miao Ming Shen as the core, Immortal Hua Die, Feng Jiang, and Gui Qi Ye are named as followers. Narration places Immortal Hua Die and Feng Jiang at rank six cultivation while Gui Qi Ye and Miao Ming Shen are rank seven. He takes turns with Hua Die and Gui Qi Ye guarding the turbulent flow sea area and asking approaching Gu Immortals for help.",
      "chapters": [
        1154
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_miao_ming_shen",
        "char_immortal_hua_die",
        "char_gui_qi_ye",
        "sys_gu_immortal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Three Eastern Sea lone immortals, Immortal Hua Die, Feng Jiang, and Gui Qi Ye, look to Miao Ming Shen as their leader in a group with common interests. After Ren Xiu Ping’s ice poison starfish trap he stands injured beside Miao Ming Shen with Immortal Hua Die.",
      "chapters": [
        1648
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "miao-ming-shen-circle",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_eastern_sea",
        "char_ren_xiu_ping"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Miao Ming Shen lists him among the eight on the blue dragon whale trip, among those he trusts most with Gui Qi Ye and Immortal Hua Die. Chu Ying is said to have saved the lives of Feng Jiang and Hua Die.",
      "chapters": [
        1650
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "blue-dragon-whale-expedition",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "On beehive island he is a rank six Gu Immortal with broad shoulders and a thin waist, wearing jade green battle armor.",
      "chapters": [
        1900
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "jade-green-armor",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "He is one of Miao Ming Shen’s followers on a mid-sized merit mission to quell red thread earthworms near beehive island without wrecking its ecology. His immortal aperture raises many bees. Yellow gyro bees are his core group: they can live with other wild bee species, reproduce, and help increase those other bees’ numbers. He is an Eastern Sea Gu Immortal rich in cultivation resources, keeping a variety of bees and more than ten desolate beast wild bees, with three desolate beast level yellow gyro bees as focus stock.",
      "chapters": [
        1900
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "bee-raising-and-beehive-island",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_yellow"
      ]
    }
  ],
